*'''Ability''': [[Strength]]

*'''Classes''': All

*'''Requires training''': No

*'''Check''': A successful check allows a character to jump over pits and vault low fences. [[Halfling]]s have a +2 racial bonus.

*'''Synergy''': If you have +5 ranks in [[Tumble]], you get a +2 to Jump checks. If you have +5 ranks in Jump, you get +2 to [[Tumble]] checks.

*'''Use''': Automatic

==Notes==
*Added with the [[PRC Expansion Pack]].

